   "originalText": "Phase 0 · measure before building\n- 3.8 Flash: 20 req/day + 503s -> 3.5 Flash-Lite\n- Exa: primary source 13/14 vs Tavily 10/14\n- the model never fills `since` -> code will\n- 'on Monday' read as NEXT Monday\n- Gemini quirks: CRLF SSE, thoughtSignature",
